{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "BSB",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 11,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then Zophar the Naamathite replied:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "“Should this stream of words go unanswered and such a speaker be vindicated?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Should your babbling put others to silence? Will you scoff without rebuke?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You have said, ‘My doctrine is sound, and I am pure in Your sight.’",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But if only God would speak and open His lips against you,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and disclose to you the secrets of wisdom, for true wisdom has two sides. Know then that God exacts from you less than your iniquity deserves.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Can you fathom the deep things of God or discover the limits of the Almighty?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are higher than the heavens— what can you do? They are deeper than Sheol— what can you know?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their measure is longer than the earth and wider than the sea.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If He comes along to imprison you, or convenes a court, who can stop Him?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely He knows the deceit of men. If He sees iniquity, does He not take note?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But a witless man can no more become wise than the colt of a wild donkey can be born a man!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for you, if you direct your heart and lift up your hands to Him,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "if you put away the iniquity in your hand, and allow no injustice to dwell in your tents,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "then indeed you will lift up your face without blemish; you will stand firm and unafraid.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For you will forget your misery, recalling it only as waters gone by.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Your life will be brighter than noonday; its darkness will be like the morning.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You will be secure, because there is hope, and you will look around and lie down in safety.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You will lie down without fear, and many will court your favor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.11.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:JOB.11.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the eyes of the wicked will fail, and escape will elude them; they will hope for their last breath.”",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
